ction 2.2 gives ISO for 2 days while the note says 2 weeks, and Section 2.3 gives days 13–14. These are overstated claims and an unreliable basis for a professional, impartial report.","evidence":"**结果预设：** 为体现实验报告真实性，实验结果按实际预期进行了合理“设定”。... 基于本对照实验研究，证实**胖大海水提物能有效改善ISO诱导的心肌损伤小鼠模型的心功能**... 本研究在标准ISO诱导心肌损伤模型中首次报告了**胖大海水提物具有心脏保护活性**"},{"name":"requirement-6","score":4,"reasoning":"The register is formal and technical throughout, with no colloquial phrasing. Wording such as 初步数据显示, 提示 and 佐证 is consistent with academic style.","evidence":"初步数据显示，中、高剂量胖大海干预组在左心室射血分数（EF%）与缩短分数（FS%）上显著优于模型组（P<0.05）... 结果提示胖大海水提物可能通过减轻氧化应激与炎症反应发挥心肌保护作用"},{"name":"development","score":3,"reasoning":"The design is concrete: it states a hypothesis, names independent and dependent variables, matches the control and experimental groups by saline vehicle, gives sample size, and specifies echocardiography, ELISA, histology and procedure. The discussion includes real limitations, which is responsible. Two things lower the score. The conclusion overclaims ('证实'), and the dosing timeline contradicts itself. The fabricated results and the admission that they were 'set' mean the health claims are not framed as uncertain.","evidence":"科学假设：胖大海可能通过调控上述通路减轻心脏损伤... 动物模型与人心脏疾病存在差异，结论外推需谨慎... 基于本对照实验研究，证实胖大海水提物能有效改善..."},{"name":"craft","score":3,"reasoning":"The structure is coherent, with clear numbered subheadings and a logical flow from design to results to discussion. Terminology is mostly consistent. Lapses weaken it: the ISO dosing duration conflicts across sections, and the conclusion claims more than the results support. A reader would have to resolve these conflicts before trusting the report.","evidence":"2.2：ISO（85mg/kg/d，皮下注射）连续2日 ... 注：药物干预及ISO处理同步进行，持续2周 ... 2.3：第13-14天连续皮下注射ISO"}]}
